<title>ITALY: Minimum rate 7.41 pct at Italy lira repo tender.</title>
<headline>Minimum rate 7.41 pct at Italy lira repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The minimum rate at today's 10.0 trillion lire 11-day Bank of Italy repurchase tender was 7.41 percent, compared with 7.45 percent at the previous repo tender on March 17, the Bank said.</p>
<p>The average rate was 7.43 percent against 7.45 percent at the last repurchase pact for 6.5 trillion lire and 15 days.</p>
<p>The pact covers purchases today and the securities are for resale on April 1. The Bank said it received 44 bids of which 13 were met in full and six in part.</p>
</text>
